# Plugin catalog

Whenever a plugin's `version` (or other catalog fields such as `plugin_api`, `name`, `description`, or `tags`) changes in any `*/plugin.toml`, regenerate the root index before finishing:

```sh
python3 .github/workflows/scripts/update-catalog.py
```

Include the updated `catalog.toml` in the same commit as the version bump, or in the commit that ships that change. Do not leave `catalog.toml` stale after a plugin version update.
